sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as ModelMesh<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Puller as model-serving-puller<br/>8084/TCP gRPC<br/>localhost
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS
    participant Adapter as Runtime Adapter<br/>8085/TCP gRPC<br/>localhost
    participant Runtime as Inference Runtime<br/>gRPC localhost

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 1: Model Loading

    MM->>Puller: LoadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Puller->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 / TLS / Provider credentials
    Storage-->>Puller: Model files
    Note over Puller: Store artifacts to<br/>local filesystem
    Puller->>Adapter: LoadModel(modelId, localPath)<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Adapter->>Runtime: Runtime-specific load<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Load confirmation
    Adapter-->>Puller: Load response
    Puller-->>MM: Load response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 2: Model Unloading

    MM->>Puller: UnloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Puller->>Adapter: UnloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Adapter->>Runtime: Runtime-specific unload<br/>gRPC / localhost / No auth
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Unload confirmation
    Adapter-->>Puller: Unload response
    Note over Puller: Delete model files<br/>from local filesystem
    Puller-->>MM: Unload response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 3: Runtime Status / Size Prediction

    MM->>Puller: runtimeStatus() / predictModelSize()<br/>gRPC / localhost
    Puller->>Adapter: Forward request<br/>gRPC / localhost
    Adapter-->>Puller: Status / size response
    Puller-->>MM: Response
